{"type":"message","id":"26a42fa8","parentId":"d96d25d9","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:04:08.441Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the facts are:\n- #57157 is in the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md (P172)\n- #57188 and #57186 are NOT in any memory file\n\nThe user says xixi found these three at 1 AM. Only #57157 made it into the tracking file. I need to be honest - I don't have records of #57188 and #57186 in the memory system. I should tell the user honestly and offer to look them up directly.","thinkingSignature":"0e91920a6065ef288dfd058f289cc7c9cc993110793b95eb545a5d7233ac96c6"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话：\n\n- **#57157** ✅ 在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（P172）\n- **#57188、#57186** ❌ 在任何 memory 文件里都找不到\n\nxixi 可能发现了但没有写入 workspace 或 project 文件。我直接去 GitHub 查一下这两个 issue：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d8t7r1bd0pu8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue view 57188 --json title,labels,state 2>&1; echo \"---\"; gh issue view 57186 --json title,labels,state 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":42005,"output":235,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63872,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774832639832,"responseId":"0618ff00a1bd79fce6d4577ccb89f849"}}
