{"type":"message","id":"66edc024","parentId":"ac2a38ea","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:05:26.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now the project file is fixed. Let me also note that I should be honest with the user about what happened: xixi found these issues at 1 AM but only #57157 was recorded in the project file; #57188 and #57186 were not transferred. I noticed this gap myself and have now added them. Let me also tell the user what these issues are about.","thinkingSignature":"dcbd88fdcce51f3c4f04361582ea6e80b621870ca605da33565fe54b33ce396b"},{"type":"text","text":"已补进 project file。\n\n坦白说：xixi 凌晨 1 点扫到了 #57188 和 #57186，但只写了 #57157 进项目文件，另外两个没有同步过来。我是刚才你问我的时候才发现缺了这两个，直接补上的。\n\n**三个 issue 现状：**\n\n| # | 标题 | 优先级 |\n|---|------|--------|\n| 57157 | `/summary` 硬编码 qwen3.3-30B | P1 |\n| 57188 | 2026.3.28 更新后 Linux VPS gateway 完全崩溃 | **P0** |\n| 57186 | voice-call EADDRINUSE port 3334 | P2 |\n\n#57188 是 P0 regression，升级后所有 channel 离线，需要快照恢复。这个优先级最高。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":46365,"output":247,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68244,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774832714233,"responseId":"0618ff4abfb2ff664d75a4a54c99253a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a3bed0f","parentId":"66edc024","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:07:36.613Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a88384d8b8b4987bd22e18d77\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-30 09:07 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a88384d8b8b4987bd22e18d77]\n范: 出现这个问题的原因是什么，后续如何避免\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774832856576}}
{"type":"message","id":"c48603e5","parentId":"7a3bed0f","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:07:54.914Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the root cause of why xixi's findings (#57188, #57186) didn't make it into the project file, and how to prevent this in the future. Let me think about what happened:\n\n1. xixi scanned at 凌晨 1 点 and found #57188, #57186, #57157\n2. Only #57157 made it into OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n3. #57188 and #57186 were missing until the user asked about them\n\nLooking at the workflow in AGENTS.md:\n- xixi cron 发现可用 bug → 发给 main → main 转发给 aoao\n\n\n- The real problem is that xixi is writing findings to a workspace file but there's no guarantee this gets synced back to the main project documentation. The cron runs and identifies these issues, but the output never reaches OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md unless someone explicitly follows up or the user asks about it.","thinkingSignature":"46299a84b6d28a668b0c8a7aee10ea78bec53067c31dc30e8d9d7b3e1057198e"},{"type":"text","text":"根本原因：**xixi 的扫描结果只写进了自己的 session 文件，没有同步到 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md。**\n\n具体来说：\n\n1. xixi cron 发现 #57188、#57186、#57157 → 按规则应该 sessions_send 发给 main\n2. 但实际执行中，xixi 只把 #57157 写进了 project 文件，另外两个**没有写入、没有推给 main**\n3. main 没有收到通知，就不知道漏了这两个\n\n**为什么没发现**：cron 反馈检查依赖的是 `sessions_history` 看 xixi 有没有发消息过来，但 xixi 根本没发。cron 本身只检查 GitHub issue 的评论，不检查 xixi workspace 里写了什么。\n\n**后续如何避免**：\n\n现在最实际的修复方式是让 xixi cron 发现 issue 时，**同时做两件事**：写进 project 文件 + 发 sessions_send 给 main。只写文件不够，必须让 main 收到通知才能形成闭环。\n\n要不要我现在就更新 xixi 的任务指令，让它以后直接更新 project 文件并抄送 main？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":423,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":45622,"totalTokens":67757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774832856613,"responseId":"0618ffd9284402659701ad47399b4bb3"}}
