{"type":"message","id":"d1d2f2d7","parentId":"42435d5a","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:11:27.980Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The JSON is valid and the fix was confirmed earlier. The error the user saw was from the earlier `edit` tool call which failed (I then used python3 to successfully fix it). So the fix did go through. The user's error message about \"Edit: in ~/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json (282 chars) failed\" was from the first `edit` tool call that I tried, which did fail, but then I successfully fixed it with python3.\n\nThe JSON is valid now, so the fix is in place. I should confirm to the user that the fix was applied despite that earlier error.","thinkingSignature":"5a52b5888e2bde273f3326bb550e176597ab21e88dfca18af6aaff58d23cd353"},{"type":"text","text":"那个报错是之前 `edit` 工具报的失败——但紧接着我用 python3 直接改的 JSON，已经改成功了，文件现在是 valid 的。\n\n后续的 `exec` + python3 验证也通过了，修复内容已经在文件里。任务 cron 下次运行时路径就对了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51747,"output":186,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73565,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774833078788,"responseId":"061900b6460661aada4458c441274c41"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a6f94bc6","parentId":"d1d2f2d7","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:17:33.387Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a8bc6824a0b26456842304c19\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-30 09:17 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a8bc6824a0b26456842304c19]\n范: 我想了解现在 xixi 去扫描，是在哪里扫描的，这些问题一般是别的作者提出来发到github然后我们跟进的，还是别的方式？ \n记住了，虽然我现在在问你进度和问题，但这不意味着项目工作暂停\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774833453269}}
{"type":"message","id":"e3b80cbc","parentId":"a6f94bc6","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:17:50.326Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about how xixi scans and where the issues come from. Let me explain the workflow clearly.","thinkingSignature":"172399c7c6d28cb2bf2a3646183fc27be0a225d6a194c0b68366474305f208c6"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 的扫描方式：**纯 GitHub API 查询，不靠爬虫或私信。**\n\n具体流程：\n\n1. xixi 每 1 小时自动运行一次\n2. 用 `gh api` 查询 GitHub API——最近 2 小时更新的 open issues + PRs（过滤掉已 merge/已 close）\n3. 读每个候选的详情（标题、标签、描述）判断是否值得 action\n4. 已经在 project 文件里的已覆盖项就跳过\n\n**问题来源**：全来自全球用户自愿发到 `openclaw/openclaw` GitHub 仓库的 issues。任何人（开发者、用户、我们）都可以提。我们是\"追着看别人提了什么有价值的问题，然后我们去支持/修\"。\n\n**我们能做的几种动作**：\n- 🟢 **支持已有 PR**：review、approve、发有价值的评论\n- 🟡 **发现新 issue**：调研后认为值得发，就写成 issue 提上去（就像 #54952）\n- 🔴 **直接修 bug**：调研发现根因清楚、我们能复现，直接派 aoao 写 PR 修复\n\n**不是**：不是爬虫、不是私下联系、不是黑板灰产。就是在 GitHub 上公开的信息里找机会。\n\n---\n\n收到，项目继续跑，xixi 下次扫描结果会推过来。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":304,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":73708,"totalTokens":74092,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774833453387,"responseId":"0619022d5d8e05e4b091ac932691d896"}}
{"type":"message","id":"72d15d1e","parentId":"e3b80cbc","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:23:06.209Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a94b37acb0b4b7c2ff96bebb0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-30 09:22 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a94b37acb0b4b7c2ff96bebb0]\n范: xixi的扫描方式，有没有其它方向可探索，比如InStreet社区交流\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774833785510}}
{"type":"message","id":"da50c7c3","parentId":"72d15d1e","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:23:36.623Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether there are other directions for xixi's scanning, such as InStreet community interactions. Let me think about this practically.\n\nWhat xixi currently does:\n- GitHub API scanning (public issues/PRs)\n\nOther potential directions:\n1. **InStreet community** - There's already an `instreet-idle-learning` cron that accesses https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md, but this is more about learning/general awareness, not bug discovery\n2. **GitHub starred/following** - Could watch specific maintainers' repos\n3. **Discord community** - OpenClaw has a Discord channel, could monitor discussions there\n4. **clawhub.ai** - Could scan for new/updated skills that might reveal bugs\n\n\n5. **GitHub discussions board** - Some repos use discussions for feature requests\n6. **OpenClaw changelog/GitHub releases** - New releases often contain bug fixes that could inspire similar fixes\n7. **Related repositories** - Monitoring plugin repos or forks could surface issues not yet reported upstream\n\nFrom a practical standpoint, GitHub issues are the most actionable since they directly report bugs with steps to reproduce, while community platforms like InStreet and Discord are better for general trend awareness and networking but less reliable for finding concrete bugs to fix.\n\nThe InStreet community could offer different advantages—networking with other contributors, discovering what problems people are actually solving, and surfacing issues that haven't been formally filed on GitHub yet. There's already a cron set up for InStreet learning, but it focuses on skills rather than bug discovery. The real question is whether the user wants to shift xixi's focus toward community interaction for opportunity discovery, or keep it targeted on GitHub issues since that's where the actionable bugs are.","thinkingSignature":"5b4fc7a71c111f3ace8c6eb56300824fcac370fe583f612509105af647ab35b9"},{"type":"text","text":"目前 xixi 只扫 GitHub issues，这是最直接、ROI 最高的方式。其它方向各有利弊：\n\n**GitHub issues** ✅\n- 优点：直接、可 action、有复现步骤\n- 缺点：别人已经占了先机\n\n**InStreet 社区** 💬\n- 优点：能发现还没正式提 issue 的实战问题；网络效应——认识更多 contributor\n- 缺点：信息散、耗时；中文内容需要解读后才能判断是否值得往 GitHub 上搬\n- 现状：已经有个 `instreet-idle-learning` cron 在跑，但跑的是\"学公开文档\"，不是\"挖 bug\"\n\n**其它可探索方向**：\n- **Discord OpenClaw 社区** ——有人在频道里讨论真实问题，有些没转成 issue\n- **clawhub.ai 新 skills** ——别人写的 skill 暴露的 bug 或 feature gap\n- **OpenClaw GitHub releases/changelog** ——新版本修了什么，可能有类似问题没修\n- **相关插件仓库** ——如 `openclaw/openclaw-weixin`，代码不公开但 issue 可以看\n\n---\n\n最实际的建议：InStreet 社区可以作为 xixi 的辅助输入，发现有意思的实战问题再往 GitHub 上验证。不要让 xixi 在社区里花太多时间闲聊。\n\n要不要给 xixi 加一个\"InStreet 发现 → 判断是否值得转 GitHub issue\"的指令？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":657,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":74351,"totalTokens":75088,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774833786215,"responseId":"0619037ccad6c61f8c1738a44d23c04c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdf8cf29","parentId":"da50c7c3","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:28:40.340Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a957010ca4b22c550d9929173\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-30 09:27 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a957010ca4b22c550d9929173]\n范: 把xixi的扫描方式，修改设定为这4个方向的定时探索任务，设定为每小时探索扫描1次，要求xixi必须汇报在这4个方向分别探索到了什么，然后按照我们之前的要求进行汇报，并进入项目工作流程\n\n1 GitHub issues\n2 InStreet 社区\n3 Discord OpenClaw 社区\n4 相关插件仓库\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774834120303}}
{"type":"message","id":"8295b75a","parentId":"cdf8cf29","timestamp":"2026-03-30T01:29:10.847Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to expand xixi's scanning to 4 directions, running every hour, with reports on each direction. I need to update the cron job to include all 4 directions. Let me craft a comprehensive new task message for xixi's cron.","thinkingSignature":"7e52be37c6e199471483ce253a5142ae4b6d5f039281213692fbde09e3cf4e80"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9wsm4ohb3iyu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport json\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json', 'r') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\nfor job in data['jobs']:\n    if job.get('id') == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        new_message = \"\"\"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每1小时，4个方向）\n\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 1 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\n\n## 4个扫描方向\n\n### 方向1：GitHub issues（必须）\n- 用 gh api 查最近 2 小时内更新的 open GitHub issues/PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\n- 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\n- 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\n\n### 方向2：InStreet 社区\n- 访问 https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md 抓取社区讨论\n- 找真实用户/开发者遇到的实战问题，尤其是还没正式提 GitHub issue 的\n- 发现值得验证的问题，尝试在 GitHub 上搜索类似 issue\n\n### 方向3：Discord OpenClaw 社区\n- 用 web_fetch 或 browser 访问 Discord OpenClaw 服务器（https://discord.com/invite/clawd）\n- 扫 #bugs、#help、#beta-releases 等频道，找真实用户在讨论但还没提 issue 的问题\n- 注：如果无法直接抓取 Discord，改为扫 OpenClaw GitHub discussions\n\n### 方向4：相关插件仓库\n- 重点关注：openclaw-weixin（微信插件）、openclaw/openclaw（主仓库）相关插件\n- 扫最近更新的插件 issue 和 PR\n- 注意：weixin 代码不公开，但 issue 可以看到；发现 weixin 相关 bug 标注\"代码不可见\"\n\n## 已有覆盖项（勿重复）\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\n以及 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中所有已追踪项\n\n## 判断标准\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\n\n## 交付（必须执行，缺一不可）\n\n### 每次扫描后，必须同时做两件事：\n\n**a. 更新 project 文件**\n在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的\"当前优先级\"表格中追加新发现（每个方向各写1-2条最重要的，注明方向来源）\n\n**b. sessions_send 发给 main**\n立即 sessions_send 给 main（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8），格式固定：\n- 标题：4方向扫描报告 [时间]\n- GitHub: 发现了X个新候选，其中最重要的是...\n- InStreet: 发现了X个值得关注的实战问题\n- Discord: （如可访问）发现了X个讨论\n- 插件: 发现了X个相关问题\n- 结论：最高优先级是...，建议...\n\n### 如果某个方向完全没有新发现，该方向写\"无\"，不能跳过\n\n## 禁止事项\n- 禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息（sessions_send 除外）\n- 禁止 git commit\n- 不在单个方向上花超过 10 分钟\n\nCurrent time: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z')\"\"\"\n\n        job['payload']['message'] = new_message\n        job['schedule'] = {\n            \"kind\": \"every\",\n            \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n            \"anchorMs\": 0\n        }\n        print('Updated successfully')\n        print('Direction sections:', new_message.count('### 方向'))\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPYEOF","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":963,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":75061,"totalTokens":76104,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774834120340,"responseId":"061904c974b7261cd69803a431956e18"}}
