{"type":"message","id":"6609c577","parentId":"f8c02282","timestamp":"2026-03-30T06:35:25.603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is again asking me to continue where I left off. This is the same continuation prompt from OpenClaw's system.\n\nLet me review the context:\n1. xixi sent another scan report at 14:17 and 14:18\n2. The key finding is two P0 issues:\n   - #57501: Isolated session model switch dead loop\n   - #57498: OpenRouter billing bypass\n3. xixi's recommendation is to dispatch aoao to investigate\n\nWhat should I do?\n- I already dispatched aoao twice and both timed out\n- aoao is having persistent timeout issues today\n- xixi is sending multiple reports rapidly\n\nI have a few options:\n1. Dispatch aoao again with a much longer timeout\n2. Try a different approach - maybe spawn a subagent with shorter timeout\n3. Wait and let aoao naturally continue (since it's isolated, it may recover)\n4. Just acknowledge and wait for aoao's natural progress\n\nGiven the persistent timeout issues, let me try a different approach - maybe the timeout is too short for a complex task like investigating MCP tool data format. Let me dispatch with a much longer timeout and more specific instruction.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"收到 xixi 新报告，派 aoao 调研 #57501 和 #57498（都是 P0）。\n\n用更长时间和更具体指令重派："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q0gyql16po0q1swl63mnw8hc","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"message":"任务：调研两个 P0 issues\n\n#57501：Isolated session model switch dead loop\n- Problem: Isolated sessions enter infinite model switching loop on tool errors\n- Impact: Sessions never complete, consuming unlimited tokens/API calls\n- Priority: P0\n\n#57498：OpenRouter billing bypass\n- Problem: OpenRouter billing not properly tracked\n- Impact: Billing data lost or incorrect\n- Priority: P0\n\n目标：\n1. 在 openclaw/openclaw 仓库中搜索相关代码\n2. 理解根因和修复方案\n3. 评估复杂度，判断是否值得修\n4. 如果值得修，直接写 PR 或提供详细修复建议\n\n交付要求：\n1. 找到代码位置和根因\n2. 确认修复方案的可行\n3. 输出具体的修复建议或代码 patch\n4. 说明是否可以直接提交 PR 或需要进一步调研\n\n重要：两个都是 P0，需要高优先级处理。","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","timeoutSeconds":900}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":97025,"output":559,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97584,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774852445289,"responseId":"021774852445717725a4f42d8843cc933295ed532bbcfabf010c3"}}
