{"type":"message","id":"5016b6d7","parentId":"d83e77b2","timestamp":"2026-03-30T06:51:35.249Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Another timeout with 900 seconds. This is very concerning. Let me think about this:\n\n1. xixi is running cron scans successfully every hour\n2. xixi sends reports to main\n3. I (main) dispatch aoao\n4. aoao keeps timing out - even with 300s, 600s, and 900s timeouts\n\nThis suggests:\n1. The task I'm giving aoao is too complex (investigating MCP tool data format + billing issues)\n2. aoao's model may be slow\n3. aoao's session configuration has issues\n\nI should acknowledge this persistent issue to the user and suggest:\n1. The project is continuing despite timeouts\n2. We might need to adjust aoao's approach or configuration\n3. The tasks might be too complex for a single dispatch - should break them down\n\nLet me acknowledge and suggest next steps.又超时（900秒都够了，但 aoao 一直没响应）。\n\n**目前情况**：\n- xixi：正常跑，每 1 小时发报告\n- main：正常收报告、派 aoao\n- aoao：连续 4 次超时（300s → 600s → 900s）\n\n**可能原因**：\n1. 两个 P0 问题（#57501、#57498）都很复杂，调研 + 找代码位置需要大量 gh/文件操作\n2. aoao 模型可能卡住\n\n**建议**：\n1. **拆任务**：不要一次派两个复杂任务，先派 #57501，等 aoao 完成后再派 #57498\n2. **换模型**：aoao 的模型可能不适用这种长调研任务\n3. **等其自恢复**：aoao 是 isolated session，可能需要重新启动\n\n---\n\n要不要我先只派 #57501（session model switch），等修完后再派 #57498？","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":97673,"output":409,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774853425887,"responseId":"021774853428657bae19a301e839859fb73b38a483a80f2137513"}}
