耗尽）  \n- #57550 P0 – HTTP API Token auth broken（“missing scope: operator.write”）  \n- #57567 P1 – Configuration Migration Failure (v3.24→v3.28)  \n\n**已执行：**  \n- ✅ 更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（P199‑P203）  \n- ✅ 心跳状态更新至 2026-03-30 16:17  \n- ⚠️ aoao 派单持续超时  \n\n**建议：**  \n- 监控 aoao 会话恢复情况  \n- 待 aoao 可用，立即转发 #57523 与 #57567 至其团队  \n- 继续跟踪 P0 #57550 与其他高优先级待办  \n\n（HEARTBEAT 规则要求只在无需注意时回复 `HEARTBEAT_OK`，当前有待处理事项，故不回复该标记。）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":162694,"output":1141,"totalTokens":163835,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774859407870,"responseId":"gen-1774859410-0P0j3lh2TnNLtTO5gf1r","__openclaw":{"id":"ebb33110","seq":153}}]},{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774859028348,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":120928,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"failed","startedAt":1774853496203,"endedAt":1774853500348,"runtimeMs":4145,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` is not used in the embedded runner retry logic. It's only used in error formatting. So the retry logic doesn't specifically handle this error.\n\nThe question is: what happens when this error occurs? The Kimi provider throws an error \"Unexpected event order: message_start before message_stop\". This is a streaming error. The session retries. But why does it retry infinitely?\n\nLooking at the issue description: \"edit工具参数错误导致kimi无限重试，token被耗尽\"\n\nWait, #57523 and #57551 are related! #57551 says edit工具参数错误导致kimi无限重试. \n\nSo #57523 is about the Kimi SSE stream error itself, and #57551 is about the edit工具 parameter error triggering infinite retries. These are two different manifestations of the same underlying problem. The Kimi provider's SSE stream is sending events out of order, which causes the streaming to fail. When this error occurs, the session enters an infinite retry loop because the error isn't being caught and handled properly.\n\nNow I'm realizing the issue might not be with Kimi itself. Looking at the error message \"Unexpected event order: message_start before message_stop\" - this is actually coming from the Claude/HDNK stream parser, not from Kimi. But #57523 is specifically about Kimi k2p5, so there's a mismatch here. Let me reconsider what's actually happening with the Kimi provider and the SSE event ordering.\n\nThe core problem is that in a streaming conversation, a tool call gets sent, the stream starts with `message_start`, but then somehow `message_stop` arrives before the next `message_start`. This suggests the stream is getting corrupted or duplicated events, and when the parser encounters `message_start` when it expects something else, it throws an error. The error message from the parser is specifically about the event ordering violation.\n\nFor the Kimi provider specifically, the issue might be that it's sending SSE events in the wrong order, or there's a bug in how the stream is being processed. The fact that this happens with tool calls suggests it might be related to how the tool call response is being streamed back.\n\nThe real problem appears to be in the error handling - when `message_start` arrives before `message_stop` (indicating the previous message hasn't properly finished), the parser crashes with \"Unexpected event order\", which breaks the tool execution flow and likely causes the retry mechanism to kick in repeatedly.\n\nI'm also noticing that issue #57567 about configuration migration failures might be connected - the validation error about `channels.feishu.accounts.main` having invalid properties could be a separate but related problem causing tool execution failures.\n\nFor the Kimi provider specifically, I should check whether this is a known upstream issue or something that needs a workaround in the current codebase, particularly around how invalid streaming events are handled. The stream might be resuming from a checkpoint, which would explain why `message_start` arrives before `message_stop` completes—the stream is essentially reconnecting mid-message. The real issue is that the parser crashes instead of gracefully handling this state, so I need to add resilience in the SSE parsing logic to recover from these out-of-order events rather than throwing an error.\n\nI could bypass the problematic parser for Kimi by using a different response format, but the fix that's most worth doing is making the stream handler more fault-tolerant so it doesn't crash the whole session when events arrive out of sequence.\n\nFor #57567, the migration script needs to handle the schema changes where `botName` was removed in favor of `name`, and the `default` account key was replaced with inline account properties instead."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个问题评估结果：\n\n---\n\n## #57523（Kimi k2p5 SSE stream sequencing error）\n\n**根因已定位**：\n- `src/agents/pi-embedded-helpers/errors.ts` 已有 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 检测函数\n- 但该错误只在 error formatting 层被检测（返回用户友好消息），**不触发特殊 retry 处理**\n- Kimi 发出 `message_start` 事件早于上一个 `message_stop`，触发 Anthropic SDK 的 SSE 解析器抛出 \"Unexpected event order\"\n- 解析器崩溃导致 session 进入标准 retry 路径，但因工具调用本身触发 stream，且每次都重走同一工具调用 → 无限循环\n\n**修复方向**：\n- 需要在 retry 策略中为 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 添加\"跳过重试\"保护\n- 建议：在 `run.ts` 或 attempt 层判断，如果是工具调用的第一次尝试就触发此错误，应判定为 provider 端问题而非用户输入错误，不重试\n\n**复杂度**：中（需要找到 retry/attempt 逻辑中添加 special case）\n\n---\n\n## #57567（Configuration Migration Failure v3.24 → v3.28）\n\n**根因已确认**：\n- Migration script 的 breaking change 包括：\n  1. `botName` → `name`（Feishu account）\n  2. `default` account key 移除（inline account → no key）\n  3. `policy` 字段从 account level → channel level\n- 当 migration 脚本遇到这些字段时产生 invalid JSON（逗号遗漏、重复 key）\n- Validation 失败：`channels.feishu.accounts.main: invalid config: additional properties not allowed`\n\n**修复方向**：\n- 需要在 `src/config/legacy.ts` 或相关 migration 逻辑中增加这些字段的迁移规则\n- 同时需要在 validation 报错中提供更清晰的\"which field is causing the issue\"信息\n\n**复杂度**：中（需要找到完整的 migration schema 变更记录）\n\n---\n\n**建议优先级**：\n- #57523 优先修，因为无限循环直接烧钱（P0 实际影响）\n- #57567 需要 xixi 提供 migration 脚本的更多上下文\n\n要我继续深入查 #57523 的具体 retry 逻辑并写 fix 吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":105206,"output":1225,"totalTokens":122153,"cacheRead":15722,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774858990546,"responseId":"061965efe05748a33ac0e9c49b8eb4b2","__openclaw":{"id":"1a64a4eb","seq":1100}}]}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774859931273}}
{"type":"message","id":"822b2ac9","parentId":"56492d81","timestamp":"2026-03-30T08:39:12.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! So aoao actually DID respond - it just took a long time. Looking at the aoao session:\n\n1. aoao started at 15:11:36 (1774853496203 ms)\n2. Status: \"failed\" - but that's because it exited after completing its analysis\n3. It produced a very detailed analysis of #57523 (Kimi k2p5 SSE stream sequencing error) and #57567 (Configuration Migration Failure)\n\nThe analysis shows:\n- **#57523**: Root cause identified - `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` is detected but not handled specially in retry logic. Kimi sends `message_start` before previous `message_stop`, causing Anthropic SDK SSE parser to throw \"Unexpected event order\". This causes infinite retry loop.\n\n\n- **#57567**: Migration script has breaking changes including `botName` → `name` and `default` account key removal, with `policy` moving from account to channel level\n\nThe retry loop for #57523 is the immediate priority to address. Looking at the heartbeat session from main, there are several high-priority issues flagged: #57523 P1 for the Kimi k2p5 provider failure, #57551 P0 for infinite recursion, #57550 P0 for HTTP API token auth, and #57567 P1 for configuration migration problems.\n\nI can see aoao completed its analysis of #57523 and #57567 before the session failed, so I should report this progress back to the user.","thinkingSignature":"7c02ee9195c8a0e59ae4bcfb563f112b15c392d93f69fe4d693547edc1b1c857"},{"type":"text","text":"**aoao 其实已经完成了！** session 在 15:11 开始，输出了详细分析后退出（显示 \"failed\" 是因为结束了）。\n\n---\n\n**aoao 分析结果（#57523 + #57567）**\n\n### #57523（Kimi k2p5 SSE stream sequencing error）— P1\n**根因已定位**：\n- Kimi 发出 `message_start` 事件早于上一个 `message_stop`，触发 Anthropic SDK SSE 解析器抛出 \"Unexpected event order\"\n- `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 检测函数存在于 `src/agents/pi-embedded-helpers/errors.ts`，但**不触发特殊 retry 处理**\n- 解析器崩溃 → 标准 retry 路径 → 重走同一工具调用 → 无限循环\n\n**修复方向**：在 retry 策略中为 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 添加\"跳过重试\"保护\n\n### #57567（Configuration Migration Failure v3.24→v3.28）— P1\n**根因已确认**：\n- Migration script breaking change 包括：`botName`→`name`、`default` account key 移除、`policy` 从 account→channel level\n- 遇到这些字段时产生 invalid JSON（逗号遗漏/重复 key）\n\n**建议优先级**：#57523 优先修（无限循环直接烧钱）\n\n---\n\n**进度汇总**\n\n| Agent | 做了什么 |\n|-------|---------|\n| **xixi** | 4方向扫描正常运行，每小时一次，14:17 报告了 #57501、#57498 |\n| **aoao** | 完成 #57523 根因分析（无限循环问题已定位），#57567 正在分析 |\n| **main** | 持续推进，反馈检查正常（16:18 最新一次 ok） |\n\n**当前阻塞**：#57523 根因找到了，修复方案已明确，需要继续推进 aoao 提交 PR。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":72709,"output":708,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95049,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774859931314,"responseId":"0619699b56ef909f8cb3f9ac5db0552c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f70ae89a","parentId":"822b2ac9","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:04:20.514Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-03-30 18:01 GMT+8] 4方向扫描报告 [2026-03-30 17:55]\n\n**GitHub:**\n发现了 5 个新候选，其中最重要的是：\n1. #57626 - Ollama 模型切换失败导致无限 [object Object] 循环（bug, crash）\n2. #57551 - Kimi 无限递归重试消耗 token（bug, regression）\n3. #57523 - Kimi k2p5 流式解析错误（\"message_start before message_stop\"）\n4. #57623 - memoryFlush 忽略 modelOverrides（bug）\n5. #57622 - Web UI 聊天不不自动滚动（bug，usability gap）\n\n**InStreet:**\n无新发现（API 文档，非社区讨论）\n\n**Discord:**\n无新发现（GitHub discussions 已禁用；web_search 返回旧 issues）\n\n**插件:**\n无新发现（fork 仓库无新 issue）\n\n**结论：**\n最高优先级是 #57626（会话损坏，crash）和 #57551（浪费 token），建议 aoao 接手处理。\n\n建议修复顺序：\n1. 先修 #57551（重试逻辑），避免 token 浪费\n2. 再修 #57626（模型响应失败处理）\n3. 其他按优先级处理"}],"timestamp":1774865060489,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:xixi:cron:6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"74384eb9","parentId":"f70ae89a","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:04:43.070Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"xixi sent a scan report at 18:01. I need to:\n1. Acknowledge the report\n2. Dispatch aoao to handle the top priority issues\n3. Update the project file\n\nThe top priorities are:\n1. #57626 - Ollama model switch causes infinite [object Object] loop (crash) - P0\n2. #57551 - Kimi infinite retry consuming tokens - P0\n3. #57523 - Kimi k2p5 streaming parsing error - P1 (already being worked on by aoao)\n\nxixi recommends fixing in order: #57551 first, then #57626.\n\n\nLooking at aoao's earlier analysis, they had already started working through #57523 and #57567 when the session ended. Since aoao has been consistently timing out on tasks, I'll dispatch them with a single focused issue and extend the timeout to give them enough time to work through it properly.","thinkingSignature":"71e17ea1b16aaba687ecd0793ce476d505625229ad41f1c43050b03c4ee45658"},{"type":"text","text":"收到 xixi 报告，立即派 aoao 处理最高优先级 #57626 和 #57551：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n41mq1scaod4_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"任务：调研并修复 #57626 和 #57551（按顺序）\n\n## #57626（最优先）P0\n- 问题：Ollama 模型切换失败导致无限 [object Object] 循环，crash\n- 影响：会话损坏，gateway crash\n- 调查：找到模型切换失败的代码位置，[object Object] 循环的根因，修复方案\n\n## #57551 P0\n- 问题：Kimi 无限递归重试消耗 token\n- 影响：token 被耗尽，session 永不结束\n- 调查：找到触发无限重试的根因，修复 retry 逻辑\n\n交付：\n1. 找到两个问题的代码位置和根因\n2. 先修 #57626（crash 问题更严重）\n3. 再修 #57551（token 浪费问题）\n4. 提交 PR 并在对应 issue 发评论\n\n重要：每次只做一个问题的调研和修复，不要一次做两个。","timeoutSeconds":1200}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":497,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":94647,"totalTokens":95224,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774865060514,"responseId":