{"type":"message","id":"0bd3199d","parentId":"b5786b35","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:39:23.430Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the last run at 18:55:37 did fail with \"Message failed\" - the delivery of the scan report failed. But actually, I did receive a scan report from xixi at 18:01... that was from 17:55 run. Let me check if there's a more recent run.\n\nWait - xixi's last run was at 18:55:37, and the error says \"Message failed\". But I received a report from xixi at 18:01 which was the 17:55 run. The 18:55 run might have failed.\n\nActually, looking at the timestamp: 1774864537984 ms / 1000 = 1774864537.984 seconds\n\n\nConverting to datetime: 2026-03-30 18:55:37 GMT+8\n\nSo the 18:55 run did fail, but I've been getting reports from earlier runs. Let me verify the current time is around 18:38, which would put the last successful run at 17:55. The issue is that xixi's cron ran at 18:55 but failed to deliver the message, so I need to get that report resent or check if there's a more recent one.\n\nLooking at the openclaw cron jobs, xixi is configured as a subagent but the others aren't, suggesting they're probably using the default agent. The xixi scan is currently errored out and overdue for its next run, so I should trigger it manually to recover.","thinkingSignature":"2587a164e9868fcf3a18b9cabefbd4762b6b183e1e13d837d4f2e78b9319abfa"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了：\n\n1. **xixi 的 cron（18:55 run）**：`\"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\"` — 报告发送给 main 失败了（\"Message failed\"）\n2. **aoao**：#57626 修复任务在后台 subagent 跑着\n3. **反馈检查**：正常，每30分钟一次\n\n需要做两件事：\n1. 手动触发 xixi 重新发送最新报告\n2. 检查 xixi 的 message 发送配置\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nix6da3msu3l_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\ndata = json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor j in data['jobs']:\n    if j.get('id') == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        print('delivery mode:', j.get('delivery',{}).get('mode'))\n        print('channel:', j.get('delivery',{}).get('channel'))\n        print('sessionTarget:', j.get('sessionTarget'))\n        print('wakeMode:', j.get('wakeMode'))\n        print('---cron msg (last 200 chars)---')\n        msg = j.get('payload',{}).get('message','')\n        print(msg[-200:])\n\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":77372,"output":618,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99622,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774867148232,"responseId":"061985cca4111a9cd407ef366736adf0"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7b9d68da","parentId":"0bd3199d","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:39:23.516Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nix6da3msu3l_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"delivery mode: none\nchannel: last\nsessionTarget: isolated\nwakeMode: now\n---cron msg (last 200 chars)---\n访问）发现了X个讨论\n- 插件: 发现了X个相关问题\n- 结论：最高优先级是...，建议...\n\n### 如果某个方向完全没有新发现，该方向写\"无\"，不能跳过\n\n## 禁止事项\n- 禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息（sessions_send 除外）\n- 禁止 git commit\n- 不在单个方向上花超过 10 分钟\n\nCurrent time: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z')"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"delivery mode: none\nchannel: last\nsessionTarget: isolated\nwakeMode: now\n---cron msg (last 200 chars)---\n访问）发现了X个讨论\n- 插件: 发现了X个相关问题\n- 结论：最高优先级是...，建议...\n\n### 如果某个方向完全没有新发现，该方向写\"无\"，不能跳过\n\n## 禁止事项\n- 禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息（sessions_send 除外）\n- 禁止 git commit\n- 不在单个方向上花超过 10 分钟\n\nCurrent time: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z')","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774867163493}}
{"type":"message","id":"00a1eb06","parentId":"7b9d68da","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:39:46.559Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue now. xixi's cron has `delivery: { mode: \"none\" }` - meaning it doesn't auto-deliver anywhere. The cron runs xixi as an isolated session, and xixi is supposed to use sessions_send to send the report to main.\n\nThe \"Message failed\" error means xixi's sessions_send to main failed. This is the same issue as with aoao - the agents can run, but when they try to send messages via sessions_send, it fails.\n\nLet me check the xixi agent configuration to understand why messages fail.Actually, looking at the sessions I received from xixi (the inter-session messages at 18:01 and 14:17), those DID come through. So xixi's sessions_send DOES work sometimes. The failure at 18:55 was just intermittent.The main issue is:\n1. xixi cron runs fine but sometimes sessions_send to main fails\n\n\n2. aoao has the same problem, but spawning it as a subagent seems to work better\n3. Both agents have authorization configured correctly for sessions_send\n\nThe aoao approach with spawning as a subagent under the main agent sidesteps the sessions_send failures entirely, so I should apply that same pattern to xixi instead of relying on its cron-based sessions_send.\n\nThe subagent mode is more reliable because it inherits the main agent's context and can communicate results directly through the parent-child session relationship. So I'll restructure xixi to run as a subagent spawned by main, triggered manually or on a timer, with reporting handled through the established completion flow.\n\nFor immediate action, I need to manually trigger xixi to rerun and resend its latest scan report since the last one failed at 18:55. Since xixi keeps timing out when I try to send it work, I'll spawn it as a subagent instead to handle the resend and any follow-up tasks.","thinkingSignature":"98f735dfa2e0fc02e280e9c531e4b289c84ef67091c21175bc3578782ea65b18"},{"type":"text","text":"问题是 xixi cron 的 `delivery: none`，报告靠 `sessions_send` 发给 main，但发送失败了。\n\n**aoao 用 subagent 方式可以绕过 sessions_send 超时问题**。同样方式处理 xixi——直接派一个扫描任务：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kcwn6lhyx2nr_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"执行 OpenClaw 4方向扫描任务（手动触发，非 cron）\n\n当前时间：2026-03-30 18:38 GMT+8\n\n## 4个扫描方向（每个必须执行）\n\n### 方向1：GitHub issues\n- gh api 查最近 2 小时内更新的 open GitHub issues/PRs\n- 过滤已 merge/已 close\n- 重点：regression、bug、usability gap\n\n### 方向2：InStreet 社区\n- 访问 https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md\n- 找 OpenClaw 相关的实战问题讨论\n\n### 方向3：Discord\n- 访问 https://discord.com/invite/clawd 扫 bugs/help 频道\n- 如果无法访问，改为 web_search 搜索 \"OpenClaw Discord bugs\"\n\n### 方向4：相关插件仓库\n- 扫 openclaw-weixin 等相关插件 issue\n\n## 判断标准\n- regression + 高严重度 → P0\n- 未确认 bug + 可本地复现 → P1\n- docs gap / usability gap → 值得发 issue\n\n## 交付（必须同时做）\n1. 更新 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md（追加新发现）\n2. 用 sessions_send 发给 main（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8）\n\n报告格式：\n- 4方向各写1-2条最重要的\n- 结论：最高优先级是...，建议...\n\n完成后直接回复结果（main 会收到）。","runtime":"subagent","agentId":"xixi","runTimeoutSeconds":900,"mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78137,"output":861,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100630,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774867163517,"responseId":"061985db5fe8840b5b3b032bb184d12d"}}
