{"type":"message","id":"67ab9c36","parentId":"e8757b50","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:44:50.871Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_g74vrl4o9s3t_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"8fc4101a-fe0e-4076-a9dd-e88ad530ab66\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"reply\": \"我已完成调研，以下是 #57626 的结论：\\n\\n---\\n\\n**1. 问题代码文件路径和行号**\\n\\n`src/gateway/live-tool-probe-utils.ts` 第 53 行：\\n```typescript\\n\\\"Malformed tool output.\\\"\\n```\\n\\n以及 `src/auto-reply/tokens.ts` 第 4 行：\\n```typescript\\nSILENT_REPLY_TOKEN = \\\"NO_REPLY\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**2. 根因是什么**\\n\\n完整的崩溃链条：\\n- Ollama 模型切换挂起（无 timeout）→ session 超出 context window（200K tokens 限制）\\n- Context overflow 触发 compaction 循环（compaction 无法精简已满的上下文）\\n- Compaction 消息被注入为 Telegram incoming message → 触发 agent 回复\\n- Compaction 消息中的 tool result 可能是 object 类型，被 agent 拼入文本 → 产生字面量 `[object Object]`\\n- 同时 `live-tool-probe-utils.ts:53` 把工具输出中的 `[object Object]` 标记为 \\\"Malformed tool output\\\"，导致工具调用持续失败\\n- 工具调用失败 + NO_REPLY → 重试循环 → gateway crash\\n\\n**[object Object] 的直接来源**：`src/gateway/live-tool-probe-utils.ts:53` —— 工具输出中的 object 被默认 toString() 序列化为 `[object Object]`。\\n\\n**3. 触发条件是什么**\\n\\n- Ollama 模型切换失败（provider 端挂起，无 timeout）\\n- Session context 超过 200K tokens\\n- Compaction 无法精简（内容已满）\\n- Compaction 消息中的 object 类型 tool result 被 agent 当作文本拼入回复\\n\\n**4. 修复方案是什么**\\n\\n两个层面的修复：\\n\\n**A. 在 model switch 添加 timeout（治本）**\\n- `src/agents/model-selection.ts` 中 Ollama provider 解析 model 时需要设置连接 timeout\\n- 防止 session 无限挂起导致 context overflow\\n\\n**B. 在 compaction 添加 message 类型过滤（治标）**\\n- `src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/compact.ts` 中，注入 compaction 消息时不应包含可能导致 `[object Object]` 的原始 tool result\\n- 或在 `live-tool-probe-utils.ts` 中，对 `[object Object]` 模式做更智能的处理，不直接标记为 \\\"Malformed tool output\\\"\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"8fc4101a-fe0e-4076-a9dd-e88ad530ab66","status":"ok","reply":"我已完成调研，以下是 #57626 的结论：\n\n---\n\n**1. 问题代码文件路径和行号**\n\n`src/gateway/live-tool-probe-utils.ts` 第 53 行：\n```typescript\n\"Malformed tool output.\"\n```\n\n以及 `src/auto-reply/tokens.ts` 第 4 行：\n```typescript\nSILENT_REPLY_TOKEN = \"NO_REPLY\"\n```\n\n**2. 根因是什么**\n\n完整的崩溃链条：\n- Ollama 模型切换挂起（无 timeout）→ session 超出 context window（200K tokens 限制）\n- Context overflow 触发 compaction 循环（compaction 无法精简已满的上下文）\n- Compaction 消息被注入为 Telegram incoming message → 触发 agent 回复\n- Compaction 消息中的 tool result 可能是 object 类型，被 agent 拼入文本 → 产生字面量 `[object Object]`\n- 同时 `live-tool-probe-utils.ts:53` 把工具输出中的 `[object Object]` 标记为 \"Malformed tool output\"，导致工具调用持续失败\n- 工具调用失败 + NO_REPLY → 重试循环 → gateway crash\n\n**[object Object] 的直接来源**：`src/gateway/live-tool-probe-utils.ts:53` —— 工具输出中的 object 被默认 toString() 序列化为 `[object Object]`。\n\n**3. 触发条件是什么**\n\n- Ollama 模型切换失败（provider 端挂起，无 timeout）\n- Session context 超过 200K tokens\n- Compaction 无法精简（内容已满）\n- Compaction 消息中的 object 类型 tool result 被 agent 当作文本拼入回复\n\n**4. 修复方案是什么**\n\n两个层面的修复：\n\n**A. 在 model switch 添加 timeout（治本）**\n- `src/agents/model-selection.ts` 中 Ollama provider 解析 model 时需要设置连接 timeout\n- 防止 session 无限挂起导致 context overflow\n\n**B. 在 compaction 添加 message 类型过滤（治标）**\n- `src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/compact.ts` 中，注入 compaction 消息时不应包含可能导致 `[object Object]` 的原始 tool result\n- 或在 `live-tool-probe-utils.ts` 中，对 `[object Object]` 模式做更智能的处理，不直接标记为 \"Malformed tool output\"","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","delivery":{"status":"pending","mode":"announce"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774867490847}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ee9fe23","parentId":"67ab9c36","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:45:14.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"aoao responded! The research is done. Now I have the conclusions for #57626. Let me summarize and then ask aoao to proceed with the fix. The user also said to follow up on whether aoao still times out - this time it worked with the simplified task (600s timeout, research-only).\n\nLet me:\n1. Report the findings to user\n2. Dispatch aoao for step 2 (fix)\n3. Track whether this fix attempt succeeds\n\nKey findings:\n- Root cause: Ollama model switch hangs (no timeout) → context overflow → compaction loop → [object Object] in messages → tool output marked as malformed → infinite retry → crash\n\n\n- Two fixes needed: add timeout to model switch, and filter object types in compaction messages","thinkingSignature":"9d75610e36e78de0e78422bac657042cf44e7f7d826aaecf1e2fe9db58d923f7"},{"type":"text","text":"**aoao 成功了！** 只派调研（简化任务，600s），10分钟收到结论。\n\n---\n\n**#57626 根因已定位：**\n\n完整崩溃链条：\n1. Ollama 模型切换**挂起无 timeout** → session 超出 200K context\n2. Context overflow → compaction 循环（无法精简已满上下文）\n3. Compaction 消息中的 **object 类型 tool result 被 agent 拼入文本** → 字面量 `[object Object]`\n4. `live-tool-probe-utils.ts:53` 把 `[object Object]` 标记为 \"Malformed tool output\" → 工具持续失败\n5. 工具失败 + NO_REPLY → **无限重试循环** → gateway crash\n\n**修复方案（两个层面）：**\n- **治本**：在 `model-selection.ts` 给 Ollama provider 加 timeout\n- **治标**：在 `compact.ts` 过滤可能导致 `[object Object]` 的原始 tool result\n\n---\n\n现在派**第二步：提交 PR**：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gtdh2gge23yn_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"【第二步：修复 #57626】\n\n根据调研结论，执行以下修复：\n\n**修复A（优先）：**\n文件：/root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw/src/gateway/live-tool-probe-utils.ts\n行号：约53行\n问题：\"Malformed tool output.\" 消息把 [object Object] 字面量当作 malformed tool output\n修复：检测 \"[object Object]\" 模式时，返回更有意义的错误消息而不是标记为 malformed\n\n**修复B（同时做）：**\n文件：/root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw/src/agents/model-selection.ts\n问题：Ollama provider 切换时无 connection timeout\n修复：为 Ollama 添加 timeout 防止 session 无限挂起\n\n步骤：\n1. 在本地 /root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw 切换到 fix/ollama-model-switch-timeout 分支\n2. 做上述两个修复\n3. 提交 commit\n4. push 到 origin/fix/ollama-model-switch-timeout\n5. 创建 PR 并在 #57626 发评论说明修复\n\n完成后汇报 PR 链接。","timeoutSeconds":600}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80465,"output":674,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102771,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774867490872,"responseId":"06198723eb107c03c67a88887d6dde5d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"dfc4809b","parentId":"9ee9fe23","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:49:19.169Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_gtdh2gge23yn_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"e277b2f4-dd6b-48e0-bcea-b2014f6b811b\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"reply\": \"**#57626 PR 已提交**\\n\\n- **PR**: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/57708\\n- **Issue 评论**: 已在 #57626 发评论说明根因和修复\\n\\n**修复内容**：\\n- **Fix A** (`live-tool-probe-utils.ts`): 检测 `[object Object]` 字面量，显式提示工具作者应返回 `JSON.stringify()` 或纯文本\\n- **Fix B** (`model-selection.ts`): 给 `ollamaProvider()` 加 30s `AbortController` timeout，防止模型切换挂起导致 context overflow\\n\\n**根因**：Ollama 模型切换无 timeout → session 超出 200K tokens → compaction 循环 → 工具输出 `[object Object]` → 重试探针 → crash loop\\n\\n---\\n\\n接下来处理 #57551（Kimi 无限重试）。是否继续？\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"e277b2f4-dd6b-48e0-bcea-b2014f6b811b","status":"ok","reply":"**#57626 PR 已提交**\n\n- **PR**: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/57708\n- **Issue 评论**: 已在 #57626 发评论说明根因和修复\n\n**修复内容**：\n- **Fix A** (`live-tool-probe-utils.ts`): 检测 `[object Object]` 字面量，显式提示工具作者应返回 `JSON.stringify()` 或纯文本\n- **Fix B** (`model-selection.ts`): 给 `ollamaProvider()` 加 30s `AbortController` timeout，防止模型切换挂起导致 context overflow\n\n**根因**：Ollama 模型切换无 timeout → session 超出 200K tokens → compaction 循环 → 工具输出 `[object Object]` → 重试探针 → crash loop\n\n---\n\n接下来处理 #57551（Kimi 无限重试）。是否继续？","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","delivery":{"status":"pending","mode":"announce"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774867759142}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9d46c07","parentId":"dfc4809b","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:49:33.305Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! aoao succeeded again! The fix for #57626 is done:\n- PR #57708 submitted\n- Comment posted on issue #57626\n- Both Fix A and Fix B implemented\n\nNow aoao is asking whether to continue with #57551. The user said to follow up on whether aoao still times out - and this time it worked perfectly (both research and fix steps succeeded).Let me:\n1. Report success to user\n2. Dispatch aoao for #57551 (Kimi infinite retry issue)Since the simplified approach worked (research first, then fix), and aoao is asking if should continue, I should say yes and dispatch for #57551.","thinkingSignature":"54870a12d2d7cb58bd0dc146eaa207220819f5b3c4b275fd5df0f640b137e10e"},{"type":"text","text":"**aoao 修复成功！✅ PR #57708 已提交**\n\n**本轮成果：**\n- ✅ Fix A：live-tool-probe-utils.ts — `[object Object]` 字面量检测改进\n- ✅ Fix B：model-selection.ts — Ollama provider 加 30s timeout\n\n---\n\naoao 问是否继续 #57551（Kimi 无限重试）。继续：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k4ahnpm9kkja_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"继续 #57551（Kimi 无限重试）\n\n【第一步：调研】\n\n任务：\n1. gh issue view 57551 读详情\n2. 在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw 搜索 Kimi 重试相关代码\n3. 找到无限重试的根因\n\n输出4条：\n1. 代码文件路径和行号\n2. 根因\n3. 触发条件\n4. 修复方案\n\n完成后直接回复这4条，不要做别的。","timeoutSeconds":600}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":81450,"output":408,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103490,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774867759170,"responseId":"0619882f404e97ed6e567f97ccc03b6c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4cf7d017","parentId":"b9d46c07","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:51:52.730Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_k4ahnpm9kkja_1","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"f5c5c356-4092-4dc9-8966-16b993cd7a59\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"reply\": \"调研完成，4条结论：\\n\\n**1. 问题代码文件路径和行号**\\n\\n`src/agents/pi-embedded-helpers/errors.ts` 第 800-810 行：\\n```typescript\\nexport function isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError(err: unknown): boolean {\\n  return isOfType(err, \\\"AiInvalidOutputError\\\");\\n}\\n```\\n**实际使用位置**：`src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run/attempt.ts` 第 591 行：\\n```typescript\\nif ((errorLike(err, \\\"Response ended unexpectedly\\\") || errorLike(err, \\\"Unexpected event order\\\")) && !tooManyAttempts) {\\n  throw OperationCorrectableError(errorMessage);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**2. 根因是什么**\\n\\n`isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 在 `errors.ts` 中已定义，但**从未被调用**（grep 返回空）。`attempt.ts` 第 591 行用的是 `errorLike()` 字符串匹配\\\"Unexpected event order\\\"，这会匹配所有包含该字符串的错误。当 Kimi 发送顺序错误的 SSE 流时，触发 `OperationCorrectableError` → retry → 每次 retry 复现同样错误 → **无限 3 次循环**。\\n\\n同时 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError(err, \\\"AiInvalidOutputError\\\")` 从未被使用，意味着这个 SSE 解析错误从未被正确归类为\\\"不可重试\\\"的 provider bug。\\n\\n**3. 触发条件是什么**\\n\\nKimi provider 发送的 SSE 流中 `message_start` 事件早于上一个 `message_stop`，被 Anthropic SDK 的 SSE 解析器拒绝。工具调用 → 流解析失败 → `OperationCorrectableError` → 触发 retry。\\n\\n**4. 修复方案是什么**\\n\\n在 `attempt.ts` 第 591 行，拆分\\\"Response ended unexpectedly\\\"（可重试）和\\\"Unexpected event order\\\"（不可重试）的处理：\\n- \\\"Response ended unexpectedly\\\" → 保持 `OperationCorrectableError`（可重试，最多 3 次）\\n- \\\"Unexpected event order\\\" → 改为抛出**非重试错误**，让 agent 记录 provider 问题但不进入重试循环\\n- 同时确保 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 在 SSE 解析层被调用，正确归类错误类型\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"mode\": \"announce\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"f5c5c356-4092-4dc9-8966-16b993cd7a59","status":"ok","reply":"调研完成，4条结论：\n\n**1. 问题代码文件路径和行号**\n\n`src/agents/pi-embedded-helpers/errors.ts` 第 800-810 行：\n```typescript\nexport function isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError(err: unknown): boolean {\n  return isOfType(err, \"AiInvalidOutputError\");\n}\n```\n**实际使用位置**：`src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run/attempt.ts` 第 591 行：\n```typescript\nif ((errorLike(err, \"Response ended unexpectedly\") || errorLike(err, \"Unexpected event order\")) && !tooManyAttempts) {\n  throw OperationCorrectableError(errorMessage);\n}\n```\n\n**2. 根因是什么**\n\n`isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 在 `errors.ts` 中已定义，但**从未被调用**（grep 返回空）。`attempt.ts` 第 591 行用的是 `errorLike()` 字符串匹配\"Unexpected event order\"，这会匹配所有包含该字符串的错误。当 Kimi 发送顺序错误的 SSE 流时，触发 `OperationCorrectableError` → retry → 每次 retry 复现同样错误 → **无限 3 次循环**。\n\n同时 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError(err, \"AiInvalidOutputError\")` 从未被使用，意味着这个 SSE 解析错误从未被正确归类为\"不可重试\"的 provider bug。\n\n**3. 触发条件是什么**\n\nKimi provider 发送的 SSE 流中 `message_start` 事件早于上一个 `message_stop`，被 Anthropic SDK 的 SSE 解析器拒绝。工具调用 → 流解析失败 → `OperationCorrectableError` → 触发 retry。\n\n**4. 修复方案是什么**\n\n在 `attempt.ts` 第 591 行，拆分\"Response ended unexpectedly\"（可重试）和\"Unexpected event order\"（不可重试）的处理：\n- \"Response ended unexpectedly\" → 保持 `OperationCorrectableError`（可重试，最多 3 次）\n- \"Unexpected event order\" → 改为抛出**非重试错误**，让 agent 记录 provider 问题但不进入重试循环\n- 同时确保 `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 在 SSE 解析层被调用，正确归类错误类型","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","delivery":{"status":"pending","mode":"announce"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774867912706}}
{"type":"message","id":"ad66d8d9","parentId":"4cf7d017","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:52:11.667Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"aoao completed the research for #57551 too! Now I need to send step 2 (fix) to aoao.\n\nKey findings:\n- Root cause: `attempt.ts` line 591 uses `errorLike()` to match \"Unexpected event order\" and treats it as `OperationCorrectableError` → retryable. But this error is actually a Kimi provider bug that won't be fixed by retrying.\n- The `isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` function exists but is never called.\n- Fix: Split the error handling - \"Response ended unexpectedly\" stays retryable, but \"Unexpected event order\" should be non-retryable.","thinkingSignature":"64e15376a589581470357879de0033c16558a44cd59d5b161ca32af47bd77435"},{"type":"text","text":"**#57551 根因已定位 ✅**\n\n根因：`attempt.ts` 第 591 行把 \"Unexpected event order\" 当作 `OperationCorrectableError`（可重试），但这是 Kimi provider bug，重试无效。`isInvalidStreamingEventOrderError` 函数存在但从未被调用。\n\n修复：把 \"Unexpected event order\" 从重试列表移到非重试错误。\n\n现在派**第二步：提交 PR**：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kkz1noeqy7j1_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"【第二步：修复 #57551】\n\n根据调研结论：\n\n文件：/root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw/src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run/attempt.ts\n行号：约591行\n\n问题：errorLike() 把 \"Unexpected event order\" 当作 OperationCorrectableError（可重试），导致无限重试\n\n修复方案：\n- 把 \"Unexpected event order\" 从重试错误中移除\n- \"Response ended unexpectedly\" 保持可重试\n- 添加注释说明 \"Unexpected event order\" 是 Kimi provider SSE 解析错误，不应重试\n\n步骤：\n1. 在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw 切换到 fix/kimi-streaming-error 分支\n2. 做修复\n3. 提交 commit\n4. push 并创建 PR\n5. 在 #57551 发评论说明修复\n\n完成后汇报 PR 链接。","timeoutSeconds":600}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":82489,"output":489,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104610,"cost":{"input":0