{"type":"message","id":"175d661d","parentId":"1f5145d2","timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:09:04.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! There's PR #57455 titled \"fix(ollama): parse stringified tool call arguments in native provider\". This looks very relevant to the #57626 issue - it mentions \"stringified tool call arguments\" which is exactly what causes \"[object Object]\" to appear.\n\nLet me check this PR to see if it's the same fix.","thinkingSignature":"0119515ec211d9c19d293c267a43f35c62d550b76322f9dd23916c7669dbd8f0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pvej1vqb19zg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/openclaw && gh pr view 57455 --json body,title,state,files,createdAt,updatedAt 2>&1 | head -60","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92018,"output":143,"cacheRead":21632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113793,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774868939557,"responseId":"06198ccb62ba0e9de32844d083b30feb"}}
{"type":"message","id":"142e17ff","parentId":"175d661d","timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:09:04.707Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pvej1vqb19zg_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Fix #57103: Some Ollama models return `tool_calls[].function.arguments` as a JSON string instead of an object, causing multi-turn tool calling to fail\\n- Parse string arguments via `safeParseJson` in both `buildAssistantMessage` (live response) and `extractToolCalls` (history replay) with `log.warn` on malformed input\\n- Widen `OllamaToolCall.arguments` type to `Record<string, unknown> | string` to reflect actual wire format\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [x] Added 4 new tests covering string args, malformed args, and history replay\\n- [x] All 35 ollama-stream tests pass\\n- [ ] Manual: configure Ollama with qwen2.5-coder, trigger multi-turn tool calls, verify second turn succeeds\\n\\n🦞 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-30T03:54:14Z\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/agents/ollama-stream.test.ts\",\"additions\":173,\"deletions\":13,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/agents/ollama-stream.ts\",\"additions\":95,\"deletions\":13,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix(ollama): parse stringified tool call arguments in native provider\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-30T04:15:04Z\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":483,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Fix #57103: Some Ollama models return `tool_calls[].function.arguments` as a JSON string instead of an object, causing multi-turn tool calling to fail\\n- Parse string arguments via `safeParseJson` in both `buildAssistantMessage` (live response) and `extractToolCalls` (history replay) with `log.warn` on malformed input\\n- Widen `OllamaToolCall.arguments` type to `Record<string, unknown> | string` to reflect actual wire format\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [x] Added 4 new tests covering string args, malformed args, and history replay\\n- [x] All 35 ollama-stream tests pass\\n- [ ] Manual: configure Ollama with qwen2.5-coder, trigger multi-turn tool calls, verify second turn succeeds\\n\\n🦞 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-30T03:54:14Z\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/agents/ollama-stream.test.ts\",\"additions\":173,\"deletions\":13,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/agents/ollama-stream.ts\",\"additions\":95,\"deletions\":13,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix(ollama): parse stringified tool call arguments in native provider\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-30T04:15:04Z\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774868944685}}
