{"type":"message","id":"0a50ee2b","parentId":"e7622a77","timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:24:45.770Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now understand the architecture:\n1. `POLL_STALL_THRESHOLD_MS = 90_000` is hardcoded in `extensions/telegram/src/polling-session.ts` line 21\n2. The config schema is in `src/config/zod-schema.providers-core.ts`\n\nThe fix would require:\n1. Adding a `stallThreshold` field to `TelegramConfigSchema` (or to `TelegramAccountSchemaBase`)\n2. Reading that config value in `polling-session.ts` instead of using the hardcoded constant\n\nHowever, this is a relatively complex change involving config schema modifications. \n\nFor a first pass, I could just bump the hardcoded default from 90 seconds to 300 seconds, though that's not ideal since the real solution is making it configurable. Let me refocus on the actual priority: I have the analysis done for #57660, but aoao keeps timing out on the file editing work. I should wrap up what I've found so far rather than continuing to chase this particular fix.","thinkingSignature":"472e2b325adab97166c61c02b6f7a065ed31cb5cb41c49549f81418ca743c90f"},{"type":"text","text":"代码已定位。总结给范总：\n\n**#57660 根因已找到：**\n- 文件：`extensions/telegram/src/polling-session.ts` 第 21 行\n- `POLL_STALL_THRESHOLD_MS = 90_000`（90秒，不是 110s）\n- 当前无配置项，硬编码写死\n\n**修复方案**：\n1. 在 `TelegramConfigSchema` 中加 `stallThreshold` 配置项\n2. 在 `polling-session.ts` 读取配置值而不是硬编码\n\n**复杂度**：中等（涉及 config schema + polling-session.ts 两处）\n\n---\n\naoao 今天在文件编辑类任务上持续超时（所有派出去的任务都超时），但调研分析是成功的。这说明 aoao 能做调研但无法完成 git 操作。\n\n**建议**：暂时让 aoao 只做调研，我来用 exec 做 commit。或者等明天重置 session 后再试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":99460,"output":401,"cacheRead":21397,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121258,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774869873715,"responseId":"061990713c06e70be3255be4319b9f31"}}
