{"type":"message","id":"e0b98151","parentId":"416fb584","timestamp":"2026-03-30T13:07:36.200Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The webchat docs are there but no actual webchat source code. The actual webchat UI is likely a separate frontend application that's not in this repository. This means #57627 (Web UI desynchronization) is a bug in a separate web-ui repository that we don't have access to.\n\nThis is important information - we can't actually fix #57627 because the web-ui code is not in the openclaw/openclaw repo.\n\nLet me report this to the user and suggest focusing on issues where we CAN make changes (issues in the main repo that we have code for).\n\nI should also note that aoao is consistently timing out on all file editing tasks, which means we can only do research tasks. For actual code fixes, we'll need to either:\n\n\n1. Wait for aoao to recover\n2. Do the edits ourselves via exec (if we know the code)\n3. Focus on issues we CAN act on\n\nFor now, let me update the project file with the new issues xixi found (P204-P226) and note that #57627 is in a separate repo we can't access.","thinkingSignature":"ee0737407ecff4c1de8f05b2195f947119653737cb5e8ed75cd36a115da42652"},{"type":"text","text":"\n重要发现：**Web UI 代码不在这个仓库**。#57627 是 webchat 前端的 bug，代码在另一个仓库，我们无法访问和修复。\n\n这个需要告诉范总：**我们只能修 openclaw/openclaw 仓库里的问题，Web UI 独立的 bug 没法改**。\n\n---\n\n**今日进展总结：**\n\n| Agent | 状态 |\n|-------|------|\n| **xixi** | ✅ 4方向扫描正常，每小时一次 |\n| **aoao** | ⚠️ 所有文件编辑任务超时（今天第 6+ 次） |\n| **main** | ✅ 调研可做，代码修复受限于 aoao 超时 |\n\n**能修的**：主仓库里的 channel/plugin/gateway bug\n**不能修的**：Web UI 独立前端 bug（代码不在此仓库）\n\n**当前最高优先级（可修的）**：\n- #57660（Telegram stall 90s 硬编码）— 代码已找到，等 aoao 超时恢复\n- #57627 — **无法修**（web-ui 独立仓库）\n- #57675 — 待查\n\n要不要我把 #57675 等新 P1 的可修性先筛一遍？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100975,"output":471,"cacheRead":21397,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122843,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"c